<%#
# Polymorphic Index Partial

This partial renders a polymorphic relationship,
to be displayed on a resource's index page.

By default, the relationship is rendered as a link to the associated object.
Replaces the Administrate partial, which wrote "User #24" for a user: every
owner is named by the display name of its own dashboard. A user (a super admin
is a user too, and has no dashboard of its own) is named by the user dashboard
and links to the page of the user.

## Local variables:

- `field`:
  An instance of [Administrate::Field::Polymorphic][1].
  A wrapper around the polymorphic belongs_to relationship
  pulled from the database.

[1]: http://www.rubydoc.info/gems/administrate/Administrate/Field/Polymorphic
%>

<% if field.data %>
  <% if field.data.is_a? User %>
    <%= link_to(UserDashboard.new.display_resource(field.data), super_admin_user_path(field.data)) %>
  <% else %>
    <%= link_to(field.display_associated_resource, [namespace, field.data]) %>
  <% end %>
<% end %>
